{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "title": "Working with JSON",
  "created_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "shared_cargo_toml": "[dependencies]\nserde = { version = \"1\", features = [\"derive\"] }\nserde_json = \"1\"\n\n[profile.release]\nopt-level = 1\nlto = false\ncodegen-units = 16",
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "cell_0",
      "order": 0,
      "label": "Introduction",
      "cell_type": "Markdown",
      "source": "> *AI authored to showcase ironpad capabilities.*\n\n# Working with JSON 🔮\n\nironpad has a built-in `Json` display type that pretty-prints JSON with syntax highlighting. It's great for exploring API responses, configuration data, or any structured data.\n\nThe `Json` type wraps a `serde_json::Value` and renders it with color-coded keys, strings, numbers, and booleans.",
      "cargo_toml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_1",
      "order": 1,
      "label": "Basic JSON",
      "cell_type": "Code",
      "source": "use serde_json::json;\n\n// Create a JSON value and display it with syntax highlighting\nlet data = json!({\n    \"name\": \"ironpad\",\n    \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n    \"features\": [\"wasm\", \"notebooks\", \"charts\"],\n    \"stats\": {\n        \"cells_compiled\": 42,\n        \"tests_passing\": 190,\n        \"is_awesome\": true\n    }\n});\n\nJson(data)\n",
      "cargo_toml": null,
      "collapsed": true,
      "saved_output": "[{\"Html\":\"<pre style=\\\"margin:0; font-family:monospace; line-height:1.5\\\"><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;features&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">[</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;wasm&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;notebooks&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;charts&quot;</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">]</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;name&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;ironpad&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;stats&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;cells_compiled&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-number, #996ACC)\\\">42</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;is_awesome&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-type, #3E8FC8)\\\">true</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;tests_passing&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-number, #996ACC)\\\">190</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;version&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;0.1.0&quot;</span>\\n<span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span></pre>\"}]"
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_2",
      "order": 2,
      "label": "Parsing Strings",
      "cell_type": "Markdown",
      "source": "## Parsing JSON Strings\n\nYou can create a `Json` value from a raw string using the standard `str::parse()` method or `serde_json::from_str`.",
      "cargo_toml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_3",
      "order": 3,
      "label": "Parse Example",
      "cell_type": "Code",
      "source": "let raw = r#\"{\n  \"users\": [\n    { \"id\": 1, \"name\": \"Alice\", \"active\": true },\n    { \"id\": 2, \"name\": \"Bob\", \"active\": false },\n    { \"id\": 3, \"name\": \"Charlie\", \"active\": true }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 3,\n  \"page\": null\n}\"#;\n\n// Parse and display — notice colors for each JSON type:\n// • keys in red\n// • strings in green\n// • numbers in blue\n// • booleans/null in purple\nlet json: Json = raw.parse().unwrap();\njson\n",
      "cargo_toml": null,
      "collapsed": true,
      "saved_output": "[{\"Html\":\"<pre style=\\\"margin:0; font-family:monospace; line-height:1.5\\\"><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;page&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-type, #3E8FC8)\\\">null</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;total&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-number, #996ACC)\\\">3</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;users&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">[</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;active&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-type, #3E8FC8)\\\">true</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-number, #996ACC)\\\">1</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;name&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;Alice&quot;</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;active&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-type, #3E8FC8)\\\">false</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-number, #996ACC)\\\">2</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;name&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;Bob&quot;</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;active&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-type, #3E8FC8)\\\">true</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-number, #996ACC)\\\">3</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;name&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;Charlie&quot;</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">]</span>\\n<span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span></pre>\"}]"
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_4",
      "order": 4,
      "label": "Combining with Http",
      "cell_type": "Markdown",
      "source": "## JSON + HTTP\n\nCombine `Json` with ironpad's HTTP helpers to fetch and display API responses beautifully.",
      "cargo_toml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_5",
      "order": 5,
      "label": "Fetch & Display",
      "cell_type": "Code",
      "source": "// Fetch a JSON API and display the response\nlet response = ironpad_cell::http::get(\"https://httpbin.org/get\").await.unwrap();\nlet value: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_str(&response).unwrap();\n\nJson(value)\n",
      "cargo_toml": null,
      "collapsed": true,
      "saved_output": "[{\"Html\":\"<pre style=\\\"margin:0; font-family:monospace; line-height:1.5\\\"><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;args&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{}</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;headers&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;Accept&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;*/*&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;Accept-Encoding&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;gzip, deflate, br, zstd&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;Host&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;httpbin.org&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;Origin&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;http://localhost:3111&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;Priority&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;u=1, i&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;Referer&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;http://localhost:3111/&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;Sec-Fetch-Dest&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;empty&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;Sec-Fetch-Mode&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;cors&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;Sec-Fetch-Site&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;cross-site&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;User-Agent&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) HeadlessChrome/145.0.7632.6 Safari/537.36&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;X-Amzn-Trace-Id&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;Root=1-6a7f6904-5c51e60678040b9f28d13416&quot;</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;origin&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;174.164.136.150&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;url&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;https://httpbin.org/get&quot;</span>\\n<span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span></pre>\"}]"
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_6",
      "order": 6,
      "label": "Structured Data",
      "cell_type": "Markdown",
      "source": "## Typed Data → JSON\n\nYou can also serialize your own Rust structs into `Json` for display. This is handy for inspecting complex data structures.",
      "cargo_toml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_7",
      "order": 7,
      "label": "Struct to JSON",
      "cell_type": "Code",
      "source": "use serde_json;\n\n#[derive(Serialize)]\nstruct Project {\n    name: String,\n    language: String,\n    stars: u64,\n    topics: Vec<String>,\n}\n\nlet projects = vec![\n    Project {\n        name: \"ironpad\".into(),\n        language: \"Rust\".into(),\n        stars: 128,\n        topics: vec![\"wasm\".into(), \"notebook\".into()],\n    },\n    Project {\n        name: \"plotters\".into(),\n        language: \"Rust\".into(),\n        stars: 4200,\n        topics: vec![\"visualization\".into(), \"svg\".into()],\n    },\n];\n\nJson(serde_json::to_value(&projects).unwrap())\n",
      "cargo_toml": null,
      "collapsed": true,
      "saved_output": "[{\"Html\":\"<pre style=\\\"margin:0; font-family:monospace; line-height:1.5\\\"><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">[</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;language&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;Rust&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;name&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;ironpad&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;stars&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-number, #996ACC)\\\">128</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;topics&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">[</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;wasm&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;notebook&quot;</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">]</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">{</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;language&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;Rust&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;name&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;plotters&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;stars&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-number, #996ACC)\\\">4200</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-keyword, #D34E68)\\\">&quot;topics&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">[</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;visualization&quot;</span><span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">,</span>\\n      <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-string, #539D6C)\\\">&quot;svg&quot;</span>\\n    <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">]</span>\\n  <span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">}</span>\\n<span style=\\\"color:var(--ip-tok-punct, #787894)\\\">]</span></pre>\"}]"
    }
  ],
  "description": "Pretty-print and explore JSON data with syntax-highlighted output.",
  "tags": [
    "json",
    "data",
    "http"
  ]
}
